  "owner_body": "- ID: `SEMANTIC-INTROSPECTION-MCP-FRONTIER.60.4.3.3.5.2.1.5.2.2.3.1.2.1.3.1.2.3.2.3.3.3.3.2.3.2.3.3.2.3.2.2.2.4.3.1`\n  Status: `done`\n  Goal: `Join the source-derived parser function order with every retained refusal phase.`\n  Acceptance: `Authenticate and reexecute committed finite source models and complete original raw inventories. Compare the independently derived own parser/context function order with every refused parser in every recorded mode. Genuine missing/extra/reordered/borrowed/wrong-function/mode/member/kind controls reject; preserve complete raw bodies and opaque outer intervals. Do not infer argument values, formatter, coordinates or identity.`\n  Verification: `Complete committed source/raw/observer member and done-owner identities authenticate at179476c83; their whole chains reexecute. Source-selected own ancestry joins every retained refused parser in ordinary/Storable/control modes without choosing intended order from native frames. Complete raw bodies and opaque outer intervals conserve; returned delegates stay excluded. Nineteen genuine source/raw/function/order/phase/mode/member/context/kind/byte-loss controls reject at intended contracts. Initial proof/programme, final proof/seal, full prerequisite receipts and saved-result regeneration retain in docs/audits/record-value-parser-function-order-20261006 and parser-function-order-checks-20261006. Typed receipt status/byte-count controls reject. The aggregate gate caught an updater field-name error; exact corrected authority and preserved failure qualify. Source cohort All tests successful Files3 Tests22; book cohort Files2 Tests308, native scoped guide/three controls, copied bytes and current source-fact/query/guide/capacity pass. Audit/book guidance only; source semantics, facade/schema/capabilities unchanged. Arguments .2, complete API/helper .3 and full publication .4.4 remain open. Mandatory staged doctrines and hooks gate commit; historical native/formatter/coordinate/identity/visual/full-CI/push gaps remain.`\n  Commit: `this function-order slice; resolve by work-unit Git subject`\n",
